<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27037" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί̆-κωλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with two limbs</i> or
				<i>legs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				636
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρίδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.94
				</span></i>
			; of a crane, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					7.60
				</span></i>
			; <i>in two sections,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύριγγες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Harm.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Rhet.,
				<i>with two members,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίοδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.
					<u>Eloc.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				p.98S.
			</span></i>:—also in metre, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1212
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
